  "prefLabel": "He-C 5004.08 Failure of Transmission",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "He-C 5004.08 Failure of Transmission.\n\n(a) All telehealth providers shall have written procedures detailing a contingency plan in the case of a failure of transmission or other technical difficulty that renders the service undeliverable.\n\n(b) A claim for payment shall not be submitted to Medicaid when the transmission fails.\n\nSource. #13651, eff 5-26-23",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/he-c5000.html"
